The foundation tokens and shared components for Slice 0 have been implemented in accordance with sections 1 to 6 of [slice_00_foundation.md](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/docs/designs/redesign/slice_00_foundation.md).

### Files Modified & Created

1. [Theme.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/Theme.kt#L144-L184)
   - Appended the field family tokens (`FieldPatient*`, `FieldObstetric*`, `FieldBackground*`, `FieldDelivery*`) and status tag tokens (`StatusIncomplete*`, `StatusModerate*`, `StatusHigh*`) for light and dark modes directly after the `Delivery*Dark*` block.
2. [RecordTokens.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/components/RecordTokens.kt)
   - Created `FieldFamily`, `FieldFamilies` (`patient`, `obstetric`, `background`, `delivery`), `LocalFieldFamily`, `currentFieldFamily()`, `RecordShapes`, `RecordSpacing`, `RecordType`, and `ltrIsolate()`.
3. [LabeledValue.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/components/LabeledValue.kt)
   - Created `LabeledValue` with 44dp minimum height Surface box, merged TalkBack semantics, and missing-value fallback.
   - Created `LabeledValueRow` with `IntrinsicSize.Min`.
   - Created `RecordRow` with 56dp minimum height Surface, 48×48dp touch target on the content column, and trailing slot.
4. [RecordSectionCard.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/components/RecordSectionCard.kt)
   - Created `RecordSectionCard` using `OutlinedCard` with `LocalFieldFamily` provider and `heading()` semantics on the section title.
   - Created `SectionTextAction` with RTL-safe `offset(x = 12.dp)` and 48×48dp touch target.
5. [StatusTag.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/components/StatusTag.kt)
   - Created `StatusKind` enum (`HighRisk`, `ModerateRisk`, `Incomplete`, `Delivered`).
   - Created `StatusTag` with theme adaptation via `isDarkTheme()`, 24dp min height, and string resource lookups.
6. [strings.xml](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml#L683-L685)
   - Added `status_delivered` ("Delivered"), `field_label_due_date` ("Due date"), and `field_label_bp` ("BP").

### Anything Not Done
None. All instructions and requirements from sections 1 to 6 were completed strictly within the specified files, with no changes to tests, build files, or existing screens.
